{
 "Battle for Stonehenge (normal)": "巨石陣之戰（一般）",
 "A mountainous area which is dominated by a powerful Roman AI. The map holds five players whose goal is to eliminate the AI.\\nIt is strongly recommended that all players play in one team.": "一片由強大羅馬電腦勢力主宰的山地。地圖可容納五名玩家，目標是消滅該電腦勢力。\\n強烈建議所有玩家組成同一隊伍。",
 "Four kingdoms (normal)": "四大王國（一般）",
 "A map with mountainous terrain and narrow passages, with a central Roman stronghold that can give an advantage to the player who manages to keep it.\\n": "山地地形、通道狹窄的地圖，中央有一座羅馬要塞，能守住的玩家將取得優勢。\\n",
 "I of the sea (normal)": "海之眼（一般）",
 "A large island map that is filled with neutral forces that guard various areas. The battles could take place either on the central island or those surrounding it. \\nThe map is best suited for two teams of two players each.": "大型島嶼地圖，各處要地皆有中立部隊駐守。戰鬥可在中央島嶼或周邊島嶼展開。\\n最適合兩隊各兩名玩家對戰。",
 "Island chaos (normal)": "群島混戰（一般）",
 "An island map that has three large islands, with two strongholds each. While players could attack each other on sea and land there are things to be gained by exploring the smaller islands.\\nThe map is best suited for three teams of two players each.": "島嶼地圖，共有三座大島，每座各有兩處要塞。玩家可在海上與陸地互相攻擊，探索小島也能有所收穫。\\n最適合三隊各兩名玩家對戰。",
 "Island troubles (huge)": "島嶼風雲（巨大）",
 "A sea map in which battles could take place in sea as well as on land. Four of the players start on their own separate islands, while the rest have direct contact with one another.": "海洋地圖，海戰與陸戰皆可展開。其中四名玩家各據一座獨立島嶼，其餘玩家則彼此接壤。",
 "Island war (normal)": "島嶼戰爭（一般）",
 "An islands map in which the western islands are occupied by Gauls and the eastern by Romans. There exist also a number of neutral islands populated by Teutons, which will give an advantage to the person who captures them.\\nThe map is best suited for two teams of three players each.": "島嶼地圖，西側島嶼由高盧人佔據，東側則屬羅馬人。另有數座中立島嶼住著條頓人，攻下者可獲得優勢。\\n最適合兩隊各三名玩家對戰。",
 "Mountain battlegrounds (normal)": "山地戰場（一般）",
 "A land map that gives the players the opportunity to match the strength of their armies in the mountainous circle in the middle of the area.": "陸地地圖，玩家可在地圖中央的環形山區一較高下。",
 "North and South (normal)": "南與北（一般）",
 "A land map with a mountain chain that splits the area in two, which makes the passage from one part to the other difficult. \\nThe map is best suited for two teams of three players each.": "陸地地圖，一道山脈將地域一分為二，往來十分不易。\\n最適合兩隊各三名玩家對戰。",
 "River of Teutons (normal)": "條頓之河（一般）",
 "A map with two teams of three players each in which the participants are additionally burdened by the constant attack of passing Teutons, as well as a large number of Teuton tents in the area.": "兩隊各三名玩家的地圖，除了彼此交戰，還得應付不斷路過的條頓人襲擊，區域內也散布著大量條頓帳篷。",
 "Riverside (small)": "河畔（小型）",
 "A land map with a river dividing the area in two parts - one under Roman control, the other belonging to the Gauls.\\nThe map is best suited for head to head games.\\n": "陸地地圖，一條河將地域分為兩半——一半由羅馬控制，另一半屬於高盧。\\n最適合一對一對戰。\\n",
 "Shattered lands (normal)": "破碎之地（一般）",
 "A coastal map with two major peninsulas, one governed by the Romans, the other by the Gauls. Because of the broken terrain battles are possible in sea as well as on land.\\nThe map is best suited for two teams of four players each.\\n": "海岸地圖，有兩座大型半島，一座由羅馬人統治，另一座屬於高盧。地形破碎，海戰與陸戰皆可進行。\\n最適合兩隊各四名玩家對戰。\\n",
 "The battle for survival (normal)": "生存之戰（一般）",
 "A land mission in which the player must escape the lake he is prisoner of and capture a stronghold in less than 3 minutes, before doing anything else.\\nThis map can be played only by human players.\\n": "陸地任務，玩家必須先逃出被囚禁的湖區，並在三分鐘內攻下一座要塞，才能做其他事情。\\n本地圖只能由真人玩家遊玩。\\n",
 "The cross shaped islands (normal)": "十字群島（一般）",
 "A sea map filled with islands of various sizes, where the players don't always have direct access with one another.": "海洋地圖，散布著大小不一的島嶼，玩家之間不一定能直接往來。",
 "The deadly triangle (normal)": "致命三角（一般）",
 "A three person map in which every player is for himself, and while attacking one's enemies directly could lead to victory there are a number of islands that could give an advantage to those who dare seek it.": "三人地圖，各自為戰。直接攻擊敵人固然可能取勝，但地圖上還有數座島嶼，敢於探索者將獲得優勢。",
 "The mountain wall (normal)": "山之壁（一般）",
 "A land map with two teams of three players each, in which both sides are separated by a large mountain chain that separates the area in two.": "陸地地圖，兩隊各三名玩家，雙方被一道貫穿地域的大山脈隔開。",
 "The northern coast (normal)": "北方海岸（一般）",
 "A coastal map with rough terrain that focuses mainly on land battles.\\nThe map is best suited for free-for-all games.": "海岸地圖，地形崎嶇，以陸戰為主。\\n最適合混戰模式。",
 "The Teuton Sun (huge)": "條頓之日（巨大）",
 "A land map abundant with numerous lakes that make traveling difficult. The one who manages to gain control of the Roman stronghold guarded by a vast number of Teutons in the center of the area will gain a great advantage.": "陸地地圖，湖泊眾多，行軍困難。地圖中央的羅馬要塞由大批條頓人守衛，能拿下者將取得極大優勢。",
 "Trial of heroes (normal)": "英雄試煉（一般）",
 "A land map with rough terrain in which each player is given a hero to start with. Since no heroes can be built each player must protect his hero as best he could.": "陸地地圖，地形崎嶇，每位玩家一開始就有一名英雄。由於無法再招募英雄，玩家必須全力保護自己的英雄。",
 "Volcano (small)": "火山（小型）",
 "A mountainous map in which the four strongholds are located near a huge volcano. Because of this there is absolutely no vegetation in the area, nor are there any neutral enemies.\\n": "山地地圖，四座要塞環繞著一座巨大火山。因此區域內完全沒有植被，也沒有任何中立敵人。\\n",
 "X marks the spot (normal)": "寶藏所在（一般）",
 "An island map that combines land battles and sea travel. While the players could concentrate their battles on the central island, there exist four smaller islands that could be explored.\\n": "島嶼地圖，兼具陸戰與航海。玩家可將戰鬥集中在中央島嶼，但周圍還有四座小島可供探索。\\n",
